-radius: 50%;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 43% 61%, #7d2922 0 24%, transparent 25%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 61% 52%, #a03b24 0 19%, transparent 20%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 67% 34%, #db8c2d 0 14%, transparent 15%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 32% 35%, #e2a23a 0 14%, transparent 15%),\n        transparent;\n    }\n\n    .caption {\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      color: #b56a24;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1.05;\n      text-align: center;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .text {\n      align-self: stretch;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .text p {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .first .text {\n      align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .first .visual {\n      padding-top: 5px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"document\">\n      <article class=\"entry first\">\n        <div class=\"visual candy\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[糖果照片：左上]</div>\n          <div class=\"caption\">卡里颂糖</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <p>Calissons卡里颂糖是一种传统的法国糖果，由光滑、淡黄色、均匀的蜜饯（尤其是甜瓜和橙子）和杏仁粉组成，上面覆盖着一层薄薄的糖霜。它们的质地类似杏仁软糖，但具有更浓郁的果味和明显的甜瓜味。通常呈杏仁状、长约五厘米。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"visual chocolate\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[巧克力照片：左侧]</div>\n          <div class=\"caption\">里昂枕形巧克力</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <p>Coussin de Lyon 是里昂高级手工巧克力，绿色外皮是杏仁泥，中间有深色巧克力，内馅是调了些许橙酒的黑巧克力馅。以用杏仁和巧克力、柑橘清香闻名于世。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"visual island\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[甜点照片：左侧]</div>\n          <div class=\"caption\">漂浮岛</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <p>Île flottante 这个具有神秘又有趣名称的甜品是法国经典甜品之一。白色胖胖的蛋清浮在蛋奶做成的英式卡仕达酱上，就像是一座无人小岛。可爱又美味。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"visual tart\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[柠檬塔照片：左侧]</div>\n          <div class=\"caption\">柠檬塔</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <p>Tarte au citron，一款历史悠久的美食，从南法城市Menton开始流行。每年的二、三月都会举办柠檬节，城中以柠檬与鲜花制作的花车游行最为盛名。在塔皮挤入柠檬奶油，再以蛋白饼或蛋白霜装饰，是现在常见的柠檬塔形式。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"visual pear\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[炖梨照片：左下]</div>\n          <div class=\"caption\">红酒炖梨</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n          <p>Poire à la Beaujolaise，法国博若莱葡萄酒产区的传统甜点，果味红酒搭配肉桂或蜂蜜、丁香、胡椒、香草与其他香料炖煮梨，梨充分入味，甜软飘香。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
